      "start_seconds": 0.67,
      "end_seconds": 3.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Hi doctor am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.78,
      "end_seconds": 10.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "you're alright take a seat what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.92,
      "end_seconds": 20.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "It's trouble sleeping. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.72,
      "end_seconds": 22.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.8,
      "end_seconds": 27.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I've had it for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.67,
      "end_seconds": 31.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "okay how much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.01,
      "end_seconds": 38.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Maybe a three out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.03,
      "end_seconds": 42.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Did you notice any hearing voices?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.29,
      "end_seconds": 45.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Nope, no hearing voices."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.03,
      "end_seconds": 51.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Have you noticed chest pain panic attacks or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.68,
      "end_seconds": 56.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.22,
      "end_seconds": 59.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "sure. Neurologically anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.51,
      "end_seconds": 62.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "No nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.94,
      "end_seconds": 76.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.08,
      "end_seconds": 81.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "so, no, I'm not allergic to to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.83,
      "end_seconds": 86.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.56,
      "end_seconds": 89.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Anxiety for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.46,
      "end_seconds": 107.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.57,
      "end_seconds": 112.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.3,
      "end_seconds": 114.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.79,
      "end_seconds": 118.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.25,
      "end_seconds": 124.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.3,
      "end_seconds": 130.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.0,
      "end_seconds": 134.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.68,
      "end_seconds": 140.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.07,
      "end_seconds": 144.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.88,
      "end_seconds": 152.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "I had keyhole surgery on my gallbladder two years back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.23,
      "end_seconds": 171.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.92,
      "end_seconds": 178.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "I'm on escitalopram 10 milligrams once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.5,
      "end_seconds": 192.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.5,
      "end_seconds": 204.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Nearly done with the the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.57,
      "end_seconds": 227.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 69, pressure 114 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.67,
      "end_seconds": 233.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "now I'm gonna do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.08,
      "end_seconds": 237.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.41,
      "end_seconds": 253.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "your pulse and blood pressure are normal and you are tearful when talking about work"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.92,
      "end_seconds": 265.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "good you can sit up again okay so my impression is this: My working impression is low mood linked to work stress"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.26,
      "end_seconds": 269.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.57,
      "end_seconds": 291.93,
      "duration_seconds": 20.36,
      "text": "I can't promise yet but most people with low mood linked to work stress do well once it's treated properly let me just check I've got this right you've had trouble sleeping for two years and no chest pain or weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.84,
      "end_seconds": 297.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "yes you've got it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.04,
      "end_seconds": 315.95,
      "duration_seconds": 16.91,
      "text": "I want a blood count done, that's for fatigue. I'll request a thyroid test, it'll help with low mood and fatigue. Try a short walk each day and keep a regular bedtime. I'll also refer you to the talking therapies service."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.54,
      "end_seconds": 318.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "alright, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.01,
      "end_seconds": 333.26,
      "duration_seconds": 14.25,
      "text": "if you have thoughts of harming yourself, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.23,
      "end_seconds": 337.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    }
  ]
